As an AI, I can create the HTML and CSS for you. Here is a simplified HTML/CSS structure for the website. Please note that it is an example, so you may need to adjust the layout, styles, and jokes accordingly:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Joke Website</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      color: #333;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .joke {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .punch {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>My Joke Website</h1>
  <p>
    <span class="joke" id="1">Batman goes to the doctor. "Doctor, I'm always cold." "Well, take off your mask."</span>
    <span class="punch" id="2">Don't leave home without it!</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    <span class="joke" id="3">Why was the math book sad? Because it had too many problems.</span>
    <span class="punch" id="4">I'm sure you can find the right answer if you look hard enough.</span>
  </p>
</body>
</html>
```
You can also include JavaScript to replace the jokes with the actual jokes and create a dynamic website. This would require some additional time and expertise on JavaScript.

